      Cleartext is required for:
      - localhost Bilibili CDN proxy
      - GPU-box LiveTalking / Ollama over Tailscale (http://…:8010 / :11434)
      When this file is present, android:usesCleartextTraffic is ignored unless
      domains (or base-config) explicitly permit cleartext.
    -->
